("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_3_0_2_0.0", "text", "Temple, Sourcery and Claimipedia are not meant to become another centre of allegiance. The hope is that their patterns become ordinary: clear sources, honest uncertainty, shared responsibility and useful cooperation.")
